## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design extensible, maintainable data processing. Candidates should show how to decouple orchestration from behavior and support runtime extensibility.

## Key Concepts

- Pipeline / Chain of Responsibility
- Dynamic step registration
- Order preservation and error propagation
- Stateless, composable steps

## Code Example

```javascript
class Pipeline {
  constructor() {
    this.steps = [];
  }
  register(step) {
    this.steps.push(step);
  }
  run(event) {
    return this.steps.reduce((e, s) => s(e), event);
  }
}

// Usage: extend without touching core
const p = new Pipeline();
p.register(e => ({ ...e, enriched: true }));
p.register(e => (e.valid ? e : { ...e, error: 'invalid' }));
const event = { payload: { id: 1 } };
const result = p.run(event);
```

